    {
      "name": "Product",
      "id": "801b7f8b-ac00-434e-a1f8-404fb6763b97",
      "description": "Product CRUD + discounts - /api/v1/product (versioned via URL segment)",
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "683f7919-665f-444f-bcb9-d5ecb91aa0fa",
          "name": "GetAll",
          "description": "Paginated list of products with optional filtering, search and sorting.\nQuery params (all optional):\n- pageNumber (default 1)\n- pageSize (default 10)\n- search (searches Name/Description; space-separated terms are ANDed)\n- categoryId\n- minPrice\n- maxPrice\n- sortBy: id | name | price | createdAt (default id)\n- sortOrder: asc | desc (default asc)\n\nPRICING: each product exposes realPrice (original/base price) and priceAfterDiscount (price after the currently active discount, null when there is none).\nNOTE: minPrice, maxPrice and sortBy=price operate on realPrice (the base price), not on priceAfterDiscount.\n\nDISCOUNTS: a discount is active when From <= now <= To. When several are active at once the lowest resulting price wins. A percentage above 100 or a fixed amount larger than the base price is clamped to 0. Category discounts are stored per product, so they behave exactly like product discounts here.",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:5090/api/v1/product/GetAll?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&search=laptop&categoryId=2&minPrice=100&maxPrice=2000&sortBy=price&sortOrder=desc",
              "protocol": "http",
"host": [
                  "localhost"
                ],
                "port": "5090",
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "product",
                "GetAll"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "pageNumber",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "Page number (min 1)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "pageSize",
                  "value": "10",
                  "description": "Page size (min 1)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "laptop",
                  "description": "Search in Name/Description"
                },
                {
                  "key": "categoryId",
                  "value": "2",
                  "description": "Filter by category id"
                },
                {
                  "key": "minPrice",
                  "value": "100",
                  "description": "Minimum price (compares against realPrice)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "maxPrice",
                  "value": "2000",
                  "description": "Maximum price (compares against realPrice)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sortBy",
                  "value": "price",
                  "description": "id | name | price (sorts by realPrice) | createdAt"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sortOrder",
                  "value": "desc",
                  "description": "asc | desc"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Product with an active discount",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "http://localhost:5090/api/v1/product/GetAll?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10",
