          "description": "Apply a discount to every product in a category. The category is expanded into per-product discount links when the discount is created, so it behaves exactly like a product-level discount on read. Soft-deleted products are skipped.\nBody (JSON):\n- categoryId: the category (required)\n- from / to: the active window, both bounds inclusive\n- discountType: 1 = Percentage, 2 = FixedAmount\n- value: the percentage, or the fixed amount\n- name: optional label",
